ion: \"Are they funny?\" I take Newport's point to "]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-622","Person/Nufar Gaspar's advice on Person/Nathaniel Whittemore/Pod/26/11 How to Deslopify Your AI fits with it: before opening an agentic tool, stop and decide what I want to do, then open it and give it the context it needs.",["My Thoughts"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-856","The question I want to discuss with colleagues is when the difficulty of a task is the point — learning, judgment, practice, writing, creative work — and when it is friction we should remove. Some difficulty is waste, and removing a barrier does not always remove the learning.",["My Thoughts"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1141","Filed",[]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1155","Person/Nathaniel Whittemore/Pod/26/10 What Anthropic’s IPO Filing Reveals",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1238","Person/Nathaniel Whittemore/Pod/26/10 What Anthropic’s IPO Filing Reveals/Takeaway",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1330","Zoom/Q/Can a Zoom meeting recording deep-link to a specific timestamp?",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1408","AI/Security/Attack/Prompt/Injection/Instruction File Poisoning",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1478","My/Pref/Writing/Call coding agents AI engines",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1531","Person/Cal Newport/Pod/26/10 Do Hard Things",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1582","Acquired/Pod/26/10 Seinfeld",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1617","Person/Nathaniel Whittemore/Pod/26/11 How to Deslopify Your AI",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1687","agentic workflows",["Filed"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1708","gh-aw/Blog/26/01/Welcome to Peli's Agent Factory",["Filed","agentic workflows"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1765","Updated",[]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1781","agentic workflows",["Updated"]],["2026-11-05%20Thu/","source-block-1802","gh-